                                "sense_id": "37b495bf-9bad-3287-b886-3f9e58f3eb94",
                                "text": "A mere glance at the plot descriptions of the show’s fourth season is enough to induce Pavlovian giggle fits and shivers of joy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
